  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760352,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1st Division Manager (Commodore 64) - Synopsis\n\nTake charge of your dream football club in *1st Division Manager*, a detailed and challenging simulation for the Commodore 64!  Choose from any of the top four English leagues and guide your team to glory.  More than just kicking a ball, you’ll manage every aspect of the club, from player training and transfers to scouting new talent and balancing the books.\n\nExperience the thrill of matchday with detailed reports following each game, revealing player injuries, crucial results from rival fixtures, and a breakdown of your weekly finances.  Careful budgeting is essential – will you invest in star players or focus on developing youth?  Tactical decisions are key; adjust formations and player roles to exploit weaknesses in your opponents. \n\n*1st Division Manager* offers a deep and rewarding management experience, demanding strategic thinking and a keen eye for detail. Can you lead your team to the Premier League title and dominate English football?  The fate of your club rests in your hands!"
    },
